      <h3 class="section-title">Agricultural groundworks</h3>
      <p class="lede-dark">Farms and equestrian sites need groundworks that stand up to heavy vehicles and wet winters. We build access tracks, manage surface water, concrete yards, install fencing and gates and carry out land improvement works.</p>
      <ul class="feature-list">
        <li>Access tracks</li>
        <li>Surface water management</li>
        <li>Yard concreting</li>
        <li>Fencing and gates</li>
        <li>Land improvement</li>
